#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:1 of
msgid "Return a random sample of rows from each group."
msgstr "从每个组中随机采样行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:3 of
msgid ""
"After groupby shuffle, each group's data is fully collected on a single "
"node, so sampling is always exact regardless of the ``exact`` parameter. "
"The ``exact`` parameter is accepted solely for API consistency with "
":meth:`LiteFrame.sample`."
msgstr ""
"经过 groupby shuffle 后，每组数据已完整收集到单个节点上，因此无论 ``exact`` "
"参数取值如何，采样始终是精确的。``exact`` 参数仅为与 :meth:`LiteFrame.sample` "
"保持 API 一致性而保留。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:8 of
msgid "Number of rows to return per group. Cannot be used with ``frac``."
msgstr "每组返回的行数。不能与 ``frac`` 同时使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:11 of
msgid "Fraction of rows to return per group. Cannot be used with ``n``."
msgstr "每组返回行的比例。不能与 ``n`` 同时使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:14 of
msgid "Allow sampling the same row more than once."
msgstr "是否允许同一行被多次采样。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:16 of
msgid ""
"Column name (str) for column-based weights, or a single-column LiteFrame "
"aligned with the data."
msgstr "用于基于列权重的列名（str），或与数据对齐的单列 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:19 of
msgid "Seed for reproducibility."
msgstr "用于可复现性的随机种子。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:21 of
msgid ""
"Accepted for API consistency with :meth:`LiteFrame.sample`. Has no effect"
" — groupby sampling is always exact."
msgstr ""
"为与 :meth:`LiteFrame.sample` 保持 API 一致性而接受。无实际效果——groupby "
"采样始终是精确的。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample:25 of
msgid "Sampled frame with one or more rows per group."
msgstr "采样后的帧，每组包含一行或多行。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.sample.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""
